Z||000004||Tigger||12-04-2001||01:50 PM||||What a game!  I lost track of how many times I've had to tell myself "Oh man, that was just wrong!"<P>Playing the missions are fun, but it's just as much of a riot stealing cars, then go do some insane stunts and just barely make it out of flaming wrecks!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif">  <P>Has anybody looked up the cheats for this game?  They are posted on some gaming sites.  You can get cars with hydraulics that jump 10ft in the air and can catch on light poles and signs!  Drive a tank around the city and cause havoc.  All weapons, lash out on innocent people with grenades, bazooka's, flamethrowers, shotguns, and an array of automatic weapons.<P>"Suspect is heading east onto Pennock Blvd...  all units beware, the suspect is armed and dangerous."<P>Uh oh.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>Hehe, definitely not a game for kids.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
