Z||000014||Tigger||12-10-2001||10:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>yeah i have it. i just got over to the second island. did you get the fast car? in a building near 8-ball's house, near the car crusher and the gas station there is a car. you have to shoot or drive through the glass with another car to get it. its suppose to be the fastest car in the game<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Smash into the windows of the dealership and steal one.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  If you wreck it don't worry, a new shiney one will be sitting at the dealer.<P>I've been using the "better driving skills" cheat with the hydraulics.  Steal a police car and flip the switch right when you hit a stunt ramp.  Oh man, all they forgot to add to this game was the General Lee.  There's a nice parking ramp in Stanton Island with a jump off the roof.  LOL, you can jump more than a city block!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ok, I watched too much Dukes of Hazzard as a kid and I've witnessed Robbie Knievel jump cars twice so that pretty much explains it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
